@startuml getReleaseNumberAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getReleaseNumberAsync – Retrieve HTTP Server Release Number
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Server Interface" as hsi #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  The requestor wants to retrieve the current release number
  of the HTTP server application.
end note

requestor -> hsi: ()
activate hsi

hsi -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hsi: HTTP server LTP List with capability
deactivate jd

note over hsi
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Access http-server-interface capability for each LTP  
  - Read release-number attribute  
  - Return release-number  
  - Return undefined if attribute not present
end note

hsi --> requestor: releaseNumber | undefined
deactivate hsi

@enduml
